# Worksheet IN-152 for 2025 (Rev. 10/25), Underpayment of 2025 Estimated
# Individual Income Tax, the latest published. The Department's site refuses
# automated downloads, so the copy hashed is the Internet Archive's capture of
# the published URL, of 2026-02-03. One anchor per line the estimated tax
# rules compute.

